<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p>This Christmas season, as part of our Christmas Aid Program, we’re providing presents and support to families and individuals in need.If you or your loved ones would like to receive a gift package, please fill out this form: https://helpgivehope.my.site.com/WishlistChristmasAidRequests/s/?recordId={{{Case.Id}}}<br />
<br />
Help Give Hope shops at the Walmart in Ozark, so please check the inventory of this store to verify the requested items are available. Each child receives $100 in gifts, please list the estimated cost of each item. Also list more than $100 in gifts so that we have alternatives if we can't find some of the items listed.<br />
<br />
Remember to list 1 clothing item for each adult. We want everyone in the family to open a gift with the children.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
The information you provide helps us organize the packages and deliver them on time. Please complete the form.</p>

<p>We are honored to share this season of giving with you.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>With warm wishes,</p>

<p>Help Give Hope</p>
</body>
</html>